{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14114370","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1411437001:1":{"text":"적당히 하지 그래? 함부로 돌아다니면서 폭탄이나 던지고 말이야!","source_cn":"你闹够了没有，到处乱跑，到处都是炸弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710AC409AB49E0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1411437002:1":{"text":"지하에서 이렇게 폭발을 일으키면 얼마나 위험한지 알고는 있는 겐가?","source_cn":"你知道在地下这么随便爆炸有多危险吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7CBA070AE025E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1411437003:1":{"text":"그게 뭐! 우리 악마들은 원래 다 이래!","source_cn":"那又怎么样！我们恶魔就是这么邪恶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0582899EDB149E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411437004:1":{"text":"다 박살 낼 거야! 날 무시한 너희들, 전부 다 똑똑히 보라고!","source_cn":"我就要炸塌一切，让你们这些看不起我的人好好瞧瞧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C26F3E721D1C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411437005:1":{"text":"...그래, 왕년에 쿠루스터가 날뛰던 모습 그대로군. 더는 봐줄 필요도 없겠어.","source_cn":"……的确，这就是库露丝塔当年癫狂的本性，看起来我也不需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18621759DF22D73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411437006:1":{"text":"누가 봐달래? 그리고 그런 옛날 이름을 들먹이지 말란 말이야. 촌스러워 죽겠네!","source_cn":"谁用你留情！而且你提什么我以前的名字啊！土死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x499647F0EB604A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411437007:1":{"text":"팡팡, 같이 이 녀석들에게 본때를 보여주자!","source_cn":"阿爆，我们一起，给这帮家伙一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC6E2B844AAB28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"바엘란","source":"巴赫朗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库露露":{"text":"쿠루루","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}